  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e13-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "高级制作人有三十七条内部守则  (Senior Producers Have Thirty-Seven Rules)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At an all-hands chief editor's meeting, Xingtian publicly commends Bu Xiaogu for resolving the copyright crisis, raising her two pay grades to senior producer alongside Kaiwen and Xingzi. Listen to Kaiwen, Xingzi, and Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "已经跟咱们俩平级了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "是跟你平级好吗？我明明比你高半级！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实找到钟阳子不是我的功劳，是公司全部的同事群策群力，才帮公司渡过难关。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "以后我会继续努力，谢谢大家！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "跟我们平级了已经，我必须好好消化一下这件事。小谷，请吃饭啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "看把你美的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，我到公司才不到一年就升职这么快，我是咱们史上升职最快的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你是我见到的第二快。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谁是第一啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "淳总。你跟我走，升职培训！高级制作人有三十七条内部守则，淳总定的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "挣钱越多麻烦越大，不想挣拉倒！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "挣！挣挣挣！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "已经跟咱们俩平级了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She's already at the exact same rank as the two of us!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "是跟你平级好吗？我明明比你高半级！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Same rank as you, okay? I'm clearly half a grade higher than you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实找到钟阳子不是我的功劳，是公司全部的同事群策群力，才帮公司渡过难关。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Honestly, finding Zhong Yangzi wasn't my solo credit — every colleague in the company pooled their strength to help us weather the crisis.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "以后我会继续努力，谢谢大家！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will keep working hard from here on out — thank you, everyone!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "跟我们平级了已经，我必须好好消化一下这件事。小谷，请吃饭啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Already on our level — I need a moment to digest this! Xiaogu, dinner is on you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "看把你美的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look how pleased with yourself you are!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，我到公司才不到一年就升职这么快，我是咱们史上升职最快的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, I've been at the company less than a year and got promoted so fast — am I the fastest promotion in company history?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你是我见到的第二快。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're the second fastest I've ever seen.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谁是第一啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who was first?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "淳总。你跟我走，升职培训！高级制作人有三十七条内部守则，淳总定的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun. Now come with me for promotion training — senior producers have thirty-seven internal rules set by Mr Chun himself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "挣钱越多麻烦越大，不想挣拉倒！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The more money you earn, the bigger the headaches — if you don't want the raise, forget it!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "挣！挣挣挣！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want it! I definitely want to earn it!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "已经跟咱们俩平级了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "是跟你平级好吗？我明明比你高半级！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实找到钟阳子不是我的功劳，是公司全部的同事群策群力，才帮公司渡过难关。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "以后我会继续努力，谢谢大家！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "跟我们平级了已经，我必须好好消化一下这件事。小谷，请吃饭啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "看把你美的！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，我到公司才不到一年就升职这么快，我是咱们史上升职最快的吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你是我见到的第二快。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谁是第一啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "淳总。你跟我走，升职培训！高级制作人有三十七条内部守则，淳总定的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "挣钱越多麻烦越大，不想挣拉倒！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "挣！挣挣挣！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Sharing credit modestly with the whole team before eagerly accepting both the raise and Chun Yuqiao's thirty-seven internal producer rules, Xiaogu steps into her new rank. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
